Author: Jordache Ramjith [aut, cre], Marianne Jonker [aut],
    Teun Bousema [aut]
Maintainer: Jordache Ramjith <jordache.ramjith@radboudumc.nl>
Description: Fits proportional hazards regression models for generalised
    interval-censored time-to-event data, including exact, right-censored,
    interval-censored and double-interval-censored observations in the same
    dataset. The baseline hazard is represented by nonnegative penalised
    B-splines and the smoothing parameter is selected by cross-validation.
    A Shiny application provides an interactive interface.
